    "answer": {
      "short": "$5.57\\text{ kg}$",
      "worked": "Class centres: $0.5,\\ 2,\\ 4,\\ 7.5,\\ 15$ kg.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sum f&=7+14+23+24+8=76\\\\\\sum(cc\\times f)&=0.5(7)+2(14)+4(23)+7.5(24)+15(8)\\\\\\sum(cc\\times f)&=423.5\\\\\\bar m&=\\frac{423.5}{76}\\\\\\bar m&\\approx5.57\\text{ kg}\\quad\\text{(2 d.p.)}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
